                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3aebaf8f-abc5-314a-8467-20daa64226ea",
                                        "entry_id": "340d6036-d60e-31ae-b8e4-028ac52f0ae0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Marijuana."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "in-plural",
                                            "often",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6c61dd3c-a543-4dcf-8567-8fb6cb94a4a6",
                                                "sense_id": "3aebaf8f-abc5-314a-8467-20daa64226ea",
                                                "text": "I like good pussy and I like good trees / Smoke so much weed you wouldn't believe"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a35a4dc2-37b9-4593-acd4-7b221bd42cae",
                                                "sense_id": "3aebaf8f-abc5-314a-8467-20daa64226ea",
                                                "text": "Everyday man's on the block / Smoke trees (ah)"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f4286324-61e1-4892-8d8e-4bfb48ff4f23",
                                                "sense_id": "3aebaf8f-abc5-314a-8467-20daa64226ea",
                                                "text": "Whiskey with the team, got it bubblin' / I got trees in my luggage, I got tings out in London / Hope UK, what you say? Fuck is you sayin'?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "34e0f1ef-909c-3b92-8dc9-fb30a542b996",
                                        "entry_id": "340d6036-d60e-31ae-b8e4-028ac52f0ae0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A cross or gallows."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7382e492-847c-4f38-ba30-507a8080ec3e",
                                                "sense_id": "34e0f1ef-909c-3b92-8dc9-fb30a542b996",
                                                "text": "Tyburn tree"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "177b578f-35f2-4e72-be01-040a51c311a0",
                                                "sense_id": "34e0f1ef-909c-3b92-8dc9-fb30a542b996",
                                                "text": "The God of our fathers raised up Jesus, whom ye slew and hanged on a tree."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0b94c475-d846-4e7e-a8e6-ce339c915210",
                                                "sense_id": "34e0f1ef-909c-3b92-8dc9-fb30a542b996",
                                                "text": "Ste[phano]. Trinculo, keepe a good tongue in your head: If you proue a mutineere, the next Tree:[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2beaf550-6bab-4e90-8f73-8da8d8e1f37b",
                                                "sense_id": "34e0f1ef-909c-3b92-8dc9-fb30a542b996",
                                                "text": "Was it for Crimes that I had done / He groan’d upon the Tree?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "984676b9-3396-4ae2-926d-437b743ee0ad",
                                                "sense_id": "34e0f1ef-909c-3b92-8dc9-fb30a542b996",
                                                "text": "When Jesus died on that tree, he bore the awful curse of the law for us so that we might be saved."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d3bde78b-46ff-43f0-8049-0b4ff4848e20",
                                                "sense_id": "34e0f1ef-909c-3b92-8dc9-fb30a542b996",
                                                "text": "Oh, that's not to say Peter's life was easy. In fact, he, too, ended up on a tree—not hung up by guilt, but crucified upside down on a cross for the sake of the One who not only hung on a tree for him, but rose and lived within him, empowering him to live a life of incredible impact and ministry."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7e4fde5d-f7b7-4f69-b7bc-08680cc2423d",
                                                "sense_id": "34e0f1ef-909c-3b92-8dc9-fb30a542b996",
                                                "text": "Jesus was crucified on a tree to give us life."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1236f1ea-812c-46a2-830c-a53b2635bc76",
                                                "sense_id": "34e0f1ef-909c-3b92-8dc9-fb30a542b996",
                                                "text": "Outside of Jerusalem, at Golgotha, Jesus was crucified on a tree with two other thieves because He claimed to be the king of the Jews."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "21ebf749-2cde-30bb-bff0-26241fd04b6b",
                                        "entry_id": "340d6036-d60e-31ae-b8e4-028ac52f0ae0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A mass of crystals, aggregated in arborescent forms, obtained by precipitation of a metal from solution."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
